r.bytes / 1024).toFixed(0)} KB, ${r.files} source files)`);\\n}\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[],\"originalFile\":null,\"userModified\":false},\"tool_result_meta\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_011AXNghJcBZQMFX4HiKHeWL\",\"permission_decision\":{\"decision\":\"accept\",\"source\":\"config\",\"reason_type\":\"mode\"}}]}"," {\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":50,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":50,\"session_id\":\"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184\",\"uuid\":\"70d3277c-3fa0-4289-9d9a-55d1b71998bc\"}","+{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"estimated_tokens\":255,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":205,\"session_id\":\"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184\",\"uuid\":\"835817da-4ee0-4130-abb6-11a4d5ad91f5\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CghPRtWap77EQrvAsb8xs\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"signature\":\"\"}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":5900,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":320670,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":5900},\"output_tokens\":8,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"global\",\"speed\":\"standard\"},\"input_transformations\":[],\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"e8aedb0d-fc32-4598-b2c3-8a34e0c85184\",\"uuid\":\"6e1907be-516e-47a2-af66-1af8f989c526\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T06:07:52.203Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CghPRtDiSpN7v2eg78qnM\",\"thinking_duration_ms\":2007,\"thinking_display\":\"updates\"}","+{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CghPRtWap77EQrvAsb8xs\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Now the core module (namespace, random streams, event bus, overlays, scene wrapper):\"}],