 Props\\n1092:## 21e. Shapes\\n1104:## 21. Ui\\n1161:## 21d. Shell\\n1190:## 22. Gpu lighting (webgpu)\\n1211:## 23. Sessions\\n1220:## Module arcade: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode (engine/modules/arcade.js)\\n1255:## Module click: point-and-click adventures: walk areas with holes, depth, hotspots, verbs, an inventory (engine/modules/click.js)\\n1300:## Module drive: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it (engine/modules/drive.js)\\n1338:## Module fight: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training (engine/modules/fight.js)\\n1419:## Module gen: generated maps: rooms and corridors, BSP, caves, mazes and scatter, from a seed (engine/modules/gen.js)\\n1430:## Module grid: square and hex grids: paths, ranges, lines, fields of view, fog, groups, movers and turns (engine/modules/grid.js)\\n1489:## Module mode7: a perspective floor drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with it, everything on it scaled by its distance (engine/modules/mode7.js)\\n1512:## Module physics: 2D rigid bodies: circles, boxes, polygons, segments; fast balls that never pass through (engine/modules/physics.js)\\n1541:## Module rhythm: charts on a song's steps, judged on the music clock: combos, grades, holds, a highway (engine/modules/rhythm.js)\\n1573:## Module road: the pseudo-3D road: segments with curves and hills, lanes, rumble strips, roadside scenery, tunnels (engine/modules/road.js)\\n1590:## Module rooms: a world of rooms joined at their edges, the map of what was explored, gates and saves (engine/modules/rooms.js)\\n1619:## Module rpg: items, inventories, equipment, shops, a party's stats and levels, status, damage, encounters (engine/modules/rpg.js)\\n1638:## Module songs: the songbook: the kits' best songs and more, and jingles, tagged by mood (engine/modules/songs.js)\\n1646:## Module story: dialogue as data, flags and values, a quest log and emote balloons (engine/modules/story.js)\\n1675:## Module strategy: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays (engine/modules/strategy.js)\\n1721:## Module terrain: destructible ground in the side plane: carved and added, walked on, drawn in chunks (engine/modules/terrain.js)\\n283:- `input.codeLabel(code)`: a code as a person reads it: 'W' (or the keyboard's own letter there), 'Space', '↑', 'Left click', and a gamepad button by its symbol on the controller in use ('A', '✕', 'B'...; glyphs picks the family)\\n297:- `input.padStyle()`: the controller family whose symbols label() shows: glyphs, or with glyphs 'auto' the one its name says\\n326:- `input.glyphs = 'auto'`: the gamepad's button symbols for label(): 'auto' (from the controller's name) | 'xbox' | 'playstation' | 'nintendo' | 'generic' (positions)\\n360:- `E.font.title(g, s, x, y, o = {})`: Big logo text for title screens: scaled glyphs with a vertical color gradient, an outline and an extruded 3D edge. title(g, 'CASTLE OF NIGHT', x, y, { scale: 3, colors: ['#fff6c8', '#ffd36a', '#e07a2a'], outline: '#1a0c10', depth: 3, depthColor: '#6a2a1a', align: 'center' })\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"7b48fecc-086c-4274-afae-e17752649adf\",\"uuid\":\"3873d66e-5a94-4420-9497-30a409facd7b\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-04T06:13:04.169Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"/bin/bash: line 1: cd: .src/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff: No such file or directory\\n1:# my-3D2dge API index (v0.85.2)\\n5:## Units and the height rules\\n22:## Examples\\n47:## Contents\\n108:## The engine object (E = My3D2dge)\\n119:## 1. Math\\n194:## 2. Pixel primitives\\n213:## 2b. Sprite frames, turns and swaps\\n219:## 3. Views (projections)\\n246:## 4. Screen\\n268:## 5. Input\\n353:## 6. Pixel font\\n364:## 7. Lighting\\n383:## 8. Particles\\n403:## 9. Renderer\\n451:## 10. Game\\n562:## 10b. Standar