e-through slot toward the camera for tall terrain in front (the Hollow rim, crags).","+- Autopilot: autoTalk (reads dialogs; Play.update calls ai.readTalk), collect() walks over drops, fails fast out of reach."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-DragonQuestBuilders-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-215521/DEVLOG.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JDPnrNzzXbt9E49Ajhj7cv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
