file (a max-effort name from another run) than TASK.md does; TASK.md wins, but it is easy to get wrong. The Source Information field Testing asks for the testing parameters allowed, which reads two ways (the rules, or what was run). Usage asks for cost and token numbers the agent cannot see.\",\"The scope: a feature-complete vertical slice of a voxel building RPG (building, rooms, residents, combat, a siege, bosses, a story chapter, multiplayer, attract mode, dev tools) on a 2D engine with no voxel support, while checking the visuals only through screenshots.\",\"Make the plan's deliverable name match TASK.md, give the agent a way to read its own token and cost usage or drop that field, and say whether Testing should list the rules or the tests run.\"],\"aiHub\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Quilt Builders\",\"tagline\":\"Stitch a frayed world back together\",\"description\":\"The dragon Frayvern pulled out the Golden Thread and swallowed everyone's knack for making things, and you are the last Builder. Break and place blocks, craft from Notions, build rooms that residents move into, raise the town of Thimbleton, defend it in a siege and unpick the knotted boss Gnarlgrim, or build a Quilt Barn together in a co-op Quilting Bee round.\",\"type\":\"Game\",\"genre\":\"RPG\",\"source\":\"Dragon Quest Builders\",\"series\":\"Dragon Quest\",\"players\":\"1–4\",\"controls\":\"Left stick or WASD move, Cross or Space jump, Square or left click swing and break, Triangle or right click place, L1 and R1 or the mouse wheel pick items, Circle or F talk, Q and E or the right stick turn the camera\",\"tags\":[\"building\",\"crafting\",\"co-op\",\"fantasy\",\"comedy\",\"pixel art\"]}};</script>"," <script src=\"../src/00-core.js\"></script>"," <script src=\"../src/01-data-blocks.js\"></script>"," <script src=\"../src/02-data-items.js\"></script>"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-Drag