{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghZ5sWeueFrfoHPGQgmP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The counts in the table hold: net 69, input 15. Now updating the `DEVLOG.md` issue list and the exit interview with what the audit found."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3175,"cache_read_input_tokens":251192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3175},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9acc64b9-af41-4198-9bbd-536ec13fbed1","uuid":"96ded28e-2d69-4428-b467-ed9ea5425670","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:14:26.644Z","request_id":"req_011CghZ5sBKmNdtQycbGF8oL"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghZ5sWeueFrfoHPGQgmP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0156jJwrn6YbH8kfg7QHjP2q","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='DEVLOG.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold=\"Total 40; critical 7 (1, 5, 8, 9, 14, 18, 21).\"\nnew=\"\"\"Found by the content audit (tests/unit/requirements.test.mjs: everything defined must be reachable and used): 3\n41. The Golden Thimble (a side-quest reward) did nothing though it promised courage: now +2 attack while carried\n42. The 'undone' jingle was never played: now plays when the Builder comes undone in the story\n43. The rock decoration was defined but never placed: now scattered on the Crags and the Coast (own RNG stream)\nTotal 43; critical 7 (1, 5, 8, 9, 14, 18, 21).\nTest-script fixes (not game bugs), made when the rocks changed the world: gatherPlant skips a target it already tried;\nM3 gathers its own Lint before the torch; the boss fight's fallback ballista searches for a free cell with a clear line.\nREQUIREMENTS.md maps every TASK.md line to the checks that verify it.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new); open(p,'w').write(s)\nimport json\np='../exit-interview.json'; j=json.load(open(p))\nj['testingFeedback'][0]=\"43, listed in DEVLOG.md: 21 caught by the scripted tests (headless suites, the network suite and the browser checks), 14 by screenshot review (HUD panels overlapping, the quest tracker covering the health bar, clipped prompt rows, tabs past the screen edge), 1 by reading code after a screenshot (Enter both turning and skipping the prologue), 4 by scans for stubs (a Bee scoring hook that did nothing, a landing squash never drawn, cutscene skips that left a training dummy or skipped a note, Dev rows with empty actions), and 3 by a content audit that requires everything defined to be used (a Golden Thimble with no effect, a jingle never played, a rock decoration never placed).\"\nj['testingFeedback'][2]=\"The scripted playthrough: an AI pilot plays Chapter One from the first quest to the credits and the side quests through the same input intents a player uses. It found the unwired quests, the path walker freeze, room detection gaps, dialogs blocking play, and story beats that left furniture blocked by plants. The content audit came second: it proves nothing defined is unused, and plants a probe of each kind to show it would catch one.\"\nj['sourceInformation']['testing']=j['sourceInformation']['testing'].replace('312 checks pass','356 checks pass, including a TASK.md requirements suite and a content audit (REQUIREMENTS.md maps each TASK.md line to its checks)')\nj['sourceInformation']['usage']=\"Cost unknown; tokens unknown; session time about 3 hours 20 minutes (2026-11-03 21:55 to about 2026-11-04 01:15, wall clock)\"\njson.dump(j,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2); open(p,'a').write('\\n')\nprint(j['sourceInformation']['testing'][-200:])\nEOF\ndate +%H:%M","description":"Update the issue list and exit interview"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3175,"cache_read_input_tokens":251192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3175},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9acc64b9-af41-4198-9bbd-536ec13fbed1","uuid":"9c8d05e6-c25a-43dc-b2b2-9491b951aea7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T08:14:36.229Z","request_id":"req_011CghZ5sBKmNdtQycbGF8oL","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0156jJwrn6YbH8kfg7QHjP2q":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-DragonQuestBuilders-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-215521 && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='DEVLOG.md'; s=open(p).read()\n