ry beats that left furniture blocked by plants. The content audit came second: it proves nothing defined is unused, and plants a probe of each kind to show it would catch one.\"\nj['sourceInformation']['testing']=j['sourceInformation']['testing'].replace('312 checks pass','356 checks pass, including a TASK.md requirements suite and a content audit (REQUIREMENTS.md maps each TASK.md line to its checks)')\nj['sourceInformation']['usage']=\"Cost unknown; tokens unknown; session time about 3 hours 20 minutes (2026-11-03 21:55 to about 2026-11-04 01:15, wall clock)\"\njson.dump(j,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2); open(p,'a').write('\\n')\nprint(j['sourceInformation']['testing'][-200:])\nEOF\ndate +%H:%M","description":"Update the issue list and exit interview"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_0156jJwrn6YbH8kfg7QHjP2q":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-xhigh.build__20261103-215521__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders-DragonQuestBuilders-claude-opus-5-5-xhigh-20261103-215521"}}}
